{"id":"leetcode-1816","version":1,"status":"approved","title":"Truncate Sentence","summary":"Given a sentence consisting of words separated by single spaces and no leading or trailing spaces, where each word contains only English letters, truncate the sentence to include only the first k words.","statement":"Given a sentence consisting of words separated by single spaces and no leading or trailing spaces, where each word contains only English letters, truncate the sentence to include only the first k words. Return the truncated sentence.","constraints":["The sentence has single spaces and no leading or trailing whitespace.","Return exactly the first k complete words."],"topics":["strings","arrays"],"prerequisites":[],"signature":{"name":"truncate_sentence","parameters":[{"name":"s","annotation":"str","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null},{"name":"k","annotation":"int","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null}],"returns":"str","return_adapter":"raw","node_policy":"values","result_mode":"return","mutated_parameter":null,"immutable_parameters":[]},"starter_code":"def truncate_sentence(s: str, k: int) -> str:\n    # Write your solution here.\n    pass\n","reference_solution":"def truncate_sentence(s, k):\n return ' '.join(s.split()[:k])\n","brute_force_solution":null,"known_wrong_solutions":["def truncate_sentence(s, k):\n return ' '.join(s.split()[:k-1])\n","def truncate_sentence(s, k):\n return ''.join(s.split()[:k])\n"],"target_time_complexity":"O(len(s))","target_space_complexity":"O(len(s))","estimated_minutes":20,"rubric":{"algorithmic_insight":1,"prerequisites":1,"implementation":1,"performance_pressure":0,"edge_cases":0},"hints":["The input guarantees that spaces already mark exact word boundaries.","Split into words, take the first k, and join with single spaces.","A slice ending at k contains indices zero through k-1.","Splitting preserves word order and the join reconstructs exactly the requested prefix without partial words."],"editorial":"Splitting preser